  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Single low broad asymmetric coiled fossil shell, visually anchored to PRI76290. Not a specimen scan, no living animal, no copied mesh or texture. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"diameter_m\": 0.11, \"working_height_m\": 0.03, \"basis\": \"PRI gives approximate shell diameter11cm. Height30mm is a conservative modelling proportion, NOT measured museum height.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Reference inspected is oblique/top preview, not underside. Flat lower face is group-level form support; exact bottom and aperture preservation are unverified and kept simple.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Single low broad asymmetric coiled fossil shell, visually anchored to PRI76290. Not a specimen scan, no living animal, no copied mesh or texture. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"diameter_m\": 0.11, \"working_height_m\": 0.03, \"basis\": \"PRI gives approximate shell diameter11cm. Height30mm is a conservative modelling proportion, NOT measured museum height.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Reference inspected is oblique/top preview, not underside. Flat lower face is group-level form support; exact bottom and aperture preservation are unverified and kept simple.\"}"
